                                  "startIndex": 26986,
                                  "endIndex": 27424,
                                  "textRun": {
                                    "content": "Intended for more intensive replenishment when an assessed deficiency calls for it; the ingredients and preparation depend on the chosen formula. Staff linked lower appeal to Singapore's hot, humid climate and a preference for lighter qing bu (清补) options. This is a retail interpretation, rather than evidence that every strong tonic is unsuitable locally. Unlike a general food tonic, a medicinal tonic needs selection according to the ",
